8944220_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=n3PRPye76_wQ7kNvwEp-CEQ&_nc_oc=AdqamchZ9AoCMQroiP1sJQelqYq2HBJnLYGCSPPA1CFAYi1T6q_YsJ1pwy2yeLaCo54&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQGhSrtR9_E-k-egWgqHVQprCNmor-s3XbbBDgRkRA_kAg&oe=6A858B85"}, {"file_name": "Arterial Line Placement_banner.00_00_10_18.Still003 (1).png", "id": "938665181894060", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491818890_938665185227393_2002801451300649644_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=pVEG2s-jOXIQ7kNvwGu-Mhu&_nc_oc=Adoui2of70WyCLCPr0djITHIDT5ddW4ENL1iflXV0NtDMrIZ85bzL--u29J8HQq9Jhc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQEutKHe2dxfdVsp-2gZ3v_yLVbI3U7A4f6YDr-4EF4H2A&oe=6A859630"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Arterial Line Placement", "keywords": ["Medvr", "VR", "Arterial", "Line", "Placement"], "long_description": "Arterial Line Placement is an immersive VR training experience designed to help medical students and healthcare professionals develop confidence and precision in arterial catheterization.\n\nThrough realistic, step-by-step simulation, users can practice identifying anatomical landmarks, performing needle insertion, and managing the procedure safely. The application provides an interactive learning environment where mistakes can be made without real-world consequences, enabling users to refine their technique and improve decision-making skills.\n\nIdeal for training, revision, or skill reinforcement, this simulation combines visual realism with guided learning to enhance procedural understanding and hands-on readiness in clinical settings.", "short_description": "Master arterial line placement in an immersive VR simulation. Practice accurate catheter insertion, identify anatomical landmarks, and build confidence in a risk-free, interactive environment designed for medical training."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_polic